id: way-of-the-champion
name: Way of the Champion
talentCategory: racial
race: earthling
prerequisites: Earthling, Experienced Fighter Racial Trait
description: >
  As a champion of the people, you empower others to become great in their own right!
text: >
  Way of the Champion: As a champion of the people, you empower others to become great in their own right!
  –Prerequisites: Earthling, Experienced Fighter Racial Trait
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls and Soak Value of your Allies by 1(T) while you are in the Spectator State.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use Experienced Fighter, rather than applying its effects to you, you may apply them to an Ally of your choice.

---

[passive]
# (1) Spectator: your Allies' Wound Rolls (chat.mjs) and Soak Value (read by each Ally, again as tokens move or a State changes)
# 1(T), yours - the best of those holding it.
allow champion.allies;
# (2) Experienced Fighter (2) used: asked, once a Round - which Ally it is readied for instead of you (chat.mjs experiencedFighter).
allow champion.share;
